Organism: SpeciesCard
Status: canonical
Role: item-detail-overlay
Interaction policy: action-required
Exports: lib/ui/product_surfaces/pack/widgets/species_card.dart
Public API: lib/ui/product_surfaces/pack/widgets/species_card.dart

Purpose:
  Phase 5 neutral presentation of one exact Pack Item. Unexamined input remains a semantic silhouette with no direct identify or reveal action; examined unidentified Items reveal shared Base Item identity and content but no Variable Property Values, preserve IUCN meaning and media fallback, and hand off only to the distinct Identification Service.
